# --- the tenth: the compile membrane's own honesty (D3, plan :129-131) --------------------
#
# WIDENED BEYOND `tab:` BY D3, and the widening is what makes it one criterion instead of two
# that can disagree about one registry: VACUITY_REGISTRY is a single artifact spanning four
# namespaces (measured 9 rows — 5 `tab:`, 3 `iladub:`, 1 `dec:`), so the criterion ranges over
# every shape wired into the compile membrane.
#
# HALF-MET, AND THE HALF IS RECORDED. The instrument EXISTS and BOTH ARMS ARE GREEN — an idle
# shape must be registered, and a registered shape that has gone live FAILS the guard until its
# row is deleted, which is what stops the registry rotting into a rubber stamp. VERIFIED
# 2026-08-21:
#   $ ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/etkl/test_vacuity_registry.py --collect-only -q
#     8 tests collected — including ::test_every_idle_shape_is_registered and
#     ::test_no_registered_shape_has_gone_live
# What is UNMET is the adjudication, not the instrument. Four registry rows read verbatim
# "RESIDUE: corpus gap or dead shape, not adjudicated here" — tab:AggregationCellShape (:105),
# tab:BaseFactShape (:108), tab:PivotedDimensionShape (:121), tab:SectionTotalShape (:124),
# re-read at those lines 2026-08-21 — and a fifth, tab:LicenceRefusalShape (:111-120), carries a
# real adjudication and is NOT one of the four. R97 covers the four; R98 records that spec §3's
# stated reason for LicenceRefusal is wrong; R99 (iladub:NoLeakShape has 11 focus nodes and
# still cannot fire, because `iladub:asserted` appears in no compiled graph) and R100
# (dec:EscalationShape live at document scope, idle at page scope, and the registry cannot say
# so) are the two D3 moved here from `dec`.
#
# THE FLIP IS NOT A GREEN TEST. Both named oracles PASS today and the criterion is still unmet:
# what is missing is four adjudications in a markdown register, which neither M5 nor M5b can
# see. M8 is what holds this row honest — while any of R97-R100 is open, `met true` is refused
# outright. That is the guard doing the work the oracles cannot.
prog:criterion:tab:10 a prog:Criterion ;
    prog:ofRung "tab" ;
    prog:statement "Every shape wired into the compile membrane is live, or registered idle with an adjudicated reason distinguishing corpus gap from dead shape; four VACUITY_REGISTRY rows still read 'corpus gap or dead shape, not adjudicated here'." ;
    prog:source "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-20-the-arc-has-a-denominator.md:129-131" ;
    prog:declaredOn "2026-08-20"^^xsd:date ;
    prog:met false ;
    prog:retrospective false ;
    prog:blockedBy "R97" , "R98" , "R99" , "R100" ;
    prog:oracleArtifact "tests/etkl/test_vacuity_registry.py:87" ;
    prog:oracleTest "tests/etkl/test_vacuity_registry.py::test_every_idle_shape_is_registered" ;
    prog:oracleTest "tests/etkl/test_vacuity_registry.py::test_no_registered_shape_has_gone_live" .
